1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,980
A psalm's last line and Jesus' last breath

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:06,460
in John close on the very same note: it is

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:06,760
done.

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,800
The psalm closes looking ahead to God's saving

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,740
work, accomplished, and told to a people not

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,220
yet born.

7
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,220
Its final line: "That he hath done this."

8
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:18,940
Done.

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,660
And as Jesus hung dying, John records His final

10
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,360
word: "It is finished".

11
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:28,200
Different words, in different tongues, a thousand

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:32,400
years apart but the same note: a finished work.

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,120
So what's left for you to finish?

14
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:40,760
Nothing only Someone to come home to: the One

15
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,520
who said it is done.
